2. Look for: "📊 Analytics initialized successfully"
   OR: "📊 Analytics not supported" (this is OK)
3. Should NOT see: "getAnalytics is not exported"
```

---

## 🔍 Debugging

### If Active Users Not Incrementing

**Check Firestore Rules:**
```javascript
rules_version = '2';
service cloud.firestore {
  match /databases/{database}/documents {
    // Allow authenticated users to write to feedback_stats
    match /feedback_stats/{document=**} {
      allow read: if true;
      allow write: if request.auth != null;
    }

    // Users can write their own document
    match /users/{userId} {
      allow read: if true;
      allow write: if request.auth != null && request.auth.uid == userId;
    }
  }
}
