1. ❌ **Not using transactions** → Race conditions
   ✅ Use `db.runTransaction()` for counters

2. ❌ **Calling registerUser on every login** → Duplicate counts
   ✅ Only increment for new users

3. ❌ **Not checking analytics support** → Errors on some browsers
